# BetterLiloan — deployment reference
#
# Nothing reads a .env file today: the site is plain static files in public/,
# copied verbatim by `astro build`. This file lists the values that are baked
# into the HTML so a fork knows what to change and where.
#
# There are no server-side secrets in this project: anything that reaches the
# browser is public by definition. Do not put credentials here.

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Canonical site URL (hardcoded in each page <head>, sitemap.xml and robots.txt)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SITE_URL=https://betterliloan.org


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Not templated — change these in source if you fork the site
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   Google Analytics ........... none (add a
#                                Liloan property to each page <head> if wanted)
#   Facebook page .............. https://www.facebook.com/municipalityliloancebu
#                                (footer and contact page; human-verified 2026-11-02)
#   Contact address ........... volunteer@betterliloan.org
#
# The Content-Security-Policy in public/_headers allow-lists the third-party
# origins these depend on. If you point them somewhere new, update the CSP to
# match or the browser will block them.
